00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:09.000
Um, I'm the dessert.

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:11.730
So, please eat me!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:13.980
If you say that...

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:17.990
Your cute red lips look like a strawberry...

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.840
...or not.

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:22.960
I'm not moving until you eat me!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:27.030
I'm going to stay here like this, all night!

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:27.540
Hey!

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:49.840
Shougo-san, what are you-

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:50.610
Look!

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:53.230
If you don't get up, I'm going to do a lot more!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:56.280
No! That's... No!

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:04.020
Tsuruma Konoe.

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:05.610
Kannagi Miyabi.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.470
Kunitachi Rinka.

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:10.040
He seems particularly close to these three.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.850
There's also Tendou Mana and Sagara Mei.

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:23.020
S-Shougo-san!

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.980
Please stop!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.770
What on earth are they doing?

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:32.940
Please stop!

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:36.960
If this goes on, I'll become strange!

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.240
W-Where is he stimulating her?

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:42.490
What sort of technique is he using to give her that much pleasure?

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:45.620
She's even making such dirty sounds!

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:49.860
I'm at my limit!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.970
Honestly...

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:16.270
Houshou-san got angry, right?

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:17.910
It seems like it.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:19.880
It's your fault, Shougo-san.

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:22.860
If you had eaten me for dessert like I told you...

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:24.530
Idiot.

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.160
You don't need to walk me any further.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.640
I can see the girls' dormitory from here.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:35.350
All right.

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:37.070
See you tomorrow.

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.300
Hey, Shougo-san...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.720
Since we're here... About that dessert...

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.510
Would you like to eat the strawberry right here?

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:46.300
Eh?

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:51.220
Konoe, does that mean...

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.980
Please eat...

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:57.450
...my strawberry.

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:01.480
S-Strawberry...

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:13.220
Even though I practised until this late, I couldn't beat the time today.

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:14.540
No, no, no!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.880
If I have time to feel depressed,

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:18.590
then I should practise more for the tournament!

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.550
What's the matter?

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:28.500
Oh, nothing.

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:30.580
I have a feeling someone is there.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.220
Eh?

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:33.810
There's no one there, is there?

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:37.310
Maybe it was my imagination...

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.230
Honestly, you're doing this again to get out of it!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:43.550
No, I didn't mean it like that.

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:53.290
Due to the reasons listed above,

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:57.420
the conclusion is that the two of you are blood-related siblings.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:21:59.650
Blood-related...

00:22:00.890 --> 00:22:02.030
...siblings?

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:07.680
So that means, after all, Yuzurina is my...

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:10.930
...little sister.

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:25.990
The love that ran away is searching for Eden

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:37.580
Despite losing my bearings, I understood the weight I felt from you

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:43.210
We felt it on that summer day

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:49.300
Do you regret our meeting because of these painful lies?

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:55.310
Are you saying it was only painful?

00:22:55.310 --> 00:23:02.940
Sweep away the coming tomorrow with those gentle hands

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:09.030
A promise forever from bygone days

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:15.790
We will certainly be together, because I still believe in you

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:21.790
My pounding heart won't stop now

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:27.880
It has finally begun, that lovely thing

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:39.600
To a dazzling world of bewilderment with my heavenly lover

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:44.600
I've finally found out who my little sister is!

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:46.960
So, does that mean that this show is ending soon?

00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:47.740
That's right.

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:50.590
Starting next week, the spin-off of Restructuring Warrior Gran Belion,

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:53.120
Robot Maid Perin-chan will be starting!

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:56.040
Please stop saying irresponsible things!

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:59.060
Next time, episode 10, The Blooming Little Sisters.

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:00.870
It's going to continue.

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:05.100
Mikadono, were you thinking that
Perin-chan would have been better?

00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:07.940
If you're going to do it, I think a proper sequel would be better.

00:24:07.940 --> 00:24:09.440
He has good taste.
